WEBVTT

00:01:43.337 --> 00:01:51.154
Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:01:51.178 --> 00:01:56.426
Baki! Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:03.066
Toba. Are you seriously gonna
fight on that worn-out knee?!

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:06.102
It's a request from the old man.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.538
Besides...

00:02:08.562 --> 00:02:09.506
What the...?!

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:12.242
In my 30 years as a wrestler...

00:02:12.266 --> 00:02:17.547
---I've never once used
this knee seriously.

00:02:17.571 --> 00:02:19.349
To the center!

00:02:19.373 --> 00:02:22.585
Aside from the use of weapons,
everything goes!

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:25.588
I am here to fight.

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:28.391
The crowd might not enjoy it much

00:02:28.415 --> 00:02:32.462
but I will be leaving once I demonstrate
the strength of pro wrestlers.

00:02:32.486 --> 00:02:35.387
| suggest you keep that in mind.

00:03:05.085 --> 00:03:11.047
"Honorable Defeat”

00:03:14.762 --> 00:03:20.166
The match begins with Mt. Toba's
extraordinary surprise attack!

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:30.720
What speed!

00:03:30.744 --> 00:03:35.807
Incredible! The Toba is
unleashing serious punches!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:43.989
--Whoa!
--Is that really Toba?!

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:05.311
Here it comes...!

00:04:10.984 --> 00:04:13.351
That would've killed him!

00:04:30.037 --> 00:04:32.048
Unbelievable...!

00:04:32.072 --> 00:04:35.718
Toba is unleashing
first-class karate kicks,

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:38.421
delivering heavyweight boxer blows,

00:04:38.445 --> 00:04:41.324
and serving up amateur
wrestler-level backdrops!

00:04:41.348 --> 00:04:44.961
This is gonna turn into
a murder show before long...!

00:04:44.985 --> 00:04:48.182
Now's your chance to run home.

00:04:49.456 --> 00:04:51.686
Did you know?

00:04:54.828 --> 00:05:02.212
Once a pro wrestler steps outside
the ring, he absolutely cannot lose.

00:05:02.236 --> 00:05:03.480
What...?!

00:05:03.504 --> 00:05:07.717
Outside the ring... we cannot lose.

00:05:07.741 --> 00:05:09.869
What's that mean... 2!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.297
At this rate, he'll be--

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:25.268
--The Giant Devil...
--Huh? What's that?!

00:05:25.292 --> 00:05:30.507
That's what they called him
the second time I visited America.

00:05:30.531 --> 00:05:35.901
At the time, Toba-kun was
the most feared Asian in America.

00:05:37.304 --> 00:05:41.417
He was trying to erase the image
of weak and scared Japanese people

00:05:41.441 --> 00:05:44.687
that America adopted after the war.

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:47.790
That's how it seemed to me, at least.

00:05:47.814 --> 00:05:53.463
Using his body to prove his strength
was the quickest way to do that.

00:05:53.487 --> 00:05:57.515
He won match after match...

00:05:58.592 --> 00:06:00.036
The Giant Devil...

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:04.307
He was so strong that even Lou Thesz,
the world champ at the time,

00:06:04.331 --> 00:06:07.477
steered clear of him.

00:06:07.501 --> 00:06:13.349
Once home, he devoted himself to
the merry world of pro wrestling,

00:06:13.373 --> 00:06:16.586
which was mostly likely
his late teacher's bidding.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:20.223
And he's kept true to it ever since.

00:06:20.247 --> 00:06:23.393
Teacher? Don't tell me you mean--

00:06:23.417 --> 00:06:29.499
But people can't live their
entire lives out like that...

00:06:29.523 --> 00:06:33.050
Especially not people like us...

00:06:34.828 --> 00:06:37.206
He surprise attacks
like a villain wrestler

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:40.043
and is many times bigger and stronger!

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.578
The champion's in trouble!

00:06:41.602 --> 00:06:45.114
My only choice is to wail
on his face's weak spots...!

00:06:45.138 --> 00:06:48.335
Gotta get him to
stoop over first, though!

00:06:57.351 --> 00:06:59.581
Yes! He landed one!

00:07:11.632 --> 00:07:13.109
He got his face!

00:07:13.133 --> 00:07:15.192
Such strength...!

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:24.377
He isn't champion for nothing. Still...

00:07:27.147 --> 00:07:28.478
His temple!

00:07:31.618 --> 00:07:33.848
And now my entire weight...!

00:07:47.134 --> 00:07:50.580
He did it!
Baki's counterattack worked!

00:07:50.604 --> 00:07:52.003
Baki...!

00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:05.094
My word...!

00:08:05.118 --> 00:08:08.164
He even does jumping roundhouses!

00:08:08.188 --> 00:08:09.766
As I thought...

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:15.752
His immunity to punches and bleeding
is on a different level than most.

00:08:16.897 --> 00:08:20.076
Doesn't anything work on him...?!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.612
What?! Master was stabbed?!

00:08:22.636 --> 00:08:25.264
Yeah! In a club, by a gangster!

00:08:28.108 --> 00:08:33.122
Master wasn't himself,
taking on gangsters like that...!

00:08:33.146 --> 00:08:36.659
Yeah, it didn't turn out
like it does in the ring...

00:08:36.683 --> 00:08:40.797
| guess this is what happens
when pro wrestlers get into fights...

00:08:40.821 --> 00:08:42.165
Master...

00:08:42.189 --> 00:08:45.768
Your crowd-pleasing wrestling...

00:08:45.792 --> 00:08:48.171
I will carry on with it...

00:08:48.195 --> 00:08:54.191
But I ask that
these words make it to you...

00:08:55.902 --> 00:09:00.499
No matter what, a pro wrestler
must not lose in a fight...

00:09:02.042 --> 00:09:07.105
It is outside the ring that
a pro wrestler must be strong...

00:09:08.482 --> 00:09:12.942
A pro wrestler's loss outside
the ring is inexcusable...

00:09:14.955 --> 00:09:19.586
What sustains a pro wrestler
is his ability to fight!

00:09:32.606 --> 00:09:34.734
Baki! Run!

00:09:50.157 --> 00:09:52.421
Toba's snapped!

00:09:54.161 --> 00:09:55.838
A sleeper hold!

00:09:55.862 --> 00:09:59.242
| told you that I wouldn't
hold back anything...

00:09:59.266 --> 00:10:02.998
That a wrestler cannot
lose outside the ring...!

00:10:05.872 --> 00:10:07.150
That no matter what...

00:10:07.174 --> 00:10:09.452
---we must not lose!

00:10:09.476 --> 00:10:13.037
Perhaps he was too much for him...?

00:10:20.554 --> 00:10:23.922
That won't work on me, Toba-san!

00:10:31.798 --> 00:10:35.063
He spit his own blood to blind him!

00:10:41.808 --> 00:10:47.757
The tenacity of using your own blood
to blind me is worthy of praise...

00:10:47.781 --> 00:10:51.727
But this body has been
pummeled on for 30 years...

00:10:51.751 --> 00:10:54.880
You will never beat me
with punches or kicks!

00:11:09.936 --> 00:11:15.918
It's working! Baki's redirecting
the attacks away from himself!

00:11:15.942 --> 00:11:21.290
The median line is hard to hit
when there is a large reach difference.

00:11:21.314 --> 00:11:25.061
For having been driven this far,
he did well to realize that.

00:11:25.085 --> 00:11:27.597
So you've started redirecting them...

00:11:27.621 --> 00:11:31.801
Unfortunately, you can
hit me thousands of times

00:11:31.825 --> 00:11:33.816
and it won't affect me!

00:11:35.395 --> 00:11:37.173
<i>I can't pull him in!</i>

00:11:37.197 --> 00:11:39.675
What I've wanted most...

00:11:39.699 --> 00:11:41.326
...is this!

00:11:49.643 --> 00:11:53.705
He's down! Toba's down!

00:12:09.396 --> 00:12:12.195
The giant has fallen!

00:12:13.767 --> 00:12:18.432
I've been... knocked down...?

00:12:24.711 --> 00:12:27.612
The arm-lock he beat Shinogi with...!

00:12:41.895 --> 00:12:46.731
A suplex! Toba tastes his own medicine!

00:12:48.268 --> 00:12:51.795
Not good! That was a poor technique...!

00:13:04.651 --> 00:13:09.680
I was hesitant at first
as I thought of your bright future.

00:13:12.826 --> 00:13:17.573
That suplex ended it.

00:13:17.597 --> 00:13:19.642
I'm no longer hesitant!

00:13:19.666 --> 00:13:23.012
Toba has returned to a basic stance.

00:13:23.036 --> 00:13:25.748
He plans to end this
with complete seriousness!

00:13:25.772 --> 00:13:28.332
He wasn't serious before?!

00:13:40.854 --> 00:13:43.432
Baki! Toba is unbeatable!

00:13:43.456 --> 00:13:47.703
His mindset when he's hit will
determine whether he goes down or not.

00:13:47.727 --> 00:13:51.755
When he's prepared to be hit,
Toba is an impregnable fortress...!

00:13:52.732 --> 00:13:55.064
Go down!

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.054
Master...

00:14:05.078 --> 00:14:09.025
That day I asked to be your pupil...

00:14:09.049 --> 00:14:15.231
When I said, "I want to use this
body to entertain people as you do,"”

00:14:15.255 --> 00:14:20.903
you suddenly punched me and yelled,
"Pro wrestling ain't a circus!"”

00:14:20.927 --> 00:14:23.973
But then you said this, too.

00:14:23.997 --> 00:14:28.144
"But that's just appearances.
It's actually just as you say."

00:14:28.168 --> 00:14:31.814
"The pro wrestling world is
all about entertaining the crowd."”

00:14:31.838 --> 00:14:37.753
"Even if you're a bad fighter,
all you need is the skill to entertain."”

00:14:37.777 --> 00:14:42.758
You fascinated people with
your charisma as a wrestler.

00:14:42.782 --> 00:14:48.380
It was because of that charisma
that I started on this path...

00:14:55.495 --> 00:15:03.345
But after I lost you, I began
to pursue true strength.

00:15:03.369 --> 00:15:10.152
Because I realized I could never
match that charisma of yours.

00:15:10.176 --> 00:15:13.422
Master... This is my first
and last request...

00:15:13.446 --> 00:15:17.493
Just once, let me fight
as a fighting master...

00:15:17.517 --> 00:15:22.264
So that I can end these
30 years of wrestling--

00:15:22.288 --> 00:15:24.733
--With no regrets!

00:15:24.757 --> 00:15:29.285
Baki's the serious one!
You had me all worried...!

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.457
That's it!

00:15:38.171 --> 00:15:41.004
What's he about to do...2?!

00:15:59.559 --> 00:16:02.358
He did it...!

00:16:05.064 --> 00:16:07.543
Hanma Baki...

00:16:07.567 --> 00:16:12.581
Most likely you will always
be ranked in my memory

00:16:12.605 --> 00:16:16.872
above the many world champions...

00:16:20.513 --> 00:16:22.491
He's intense...

00:16:22.515 --> 00:16:24.882
This the end?!

00:16:26.619 --> 00:16:28.564
Sir!

00:16:28.588 --> 00:16:34.118
This was a great match.
| can't express my gratitude.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:46.268
It couldn't be...

00:16:49.509 --> 00:16:52.308
This fighting spirit...!

00:16:59.185 --> 00:17:01.931
Despite taking that much damage,

00:17:01.955 --> 00:17:04.900
you still have the
fighting spirit of a beast...?

00:17:04.924 --> 00:17:07.937
Although hard on Toba-kun,
there WAS the shame

00:17:07.961 --> 00:17:11.373
of having not fought a full fight...

00:17:11.397 --> 00:17:16.812
It wasn't much, but it seems he's
given him a chance to recover...

00:17:16.836 --> 00:17:21.069
Just where are you going?!
We're in the middle of a battle here!

00:17:25.845 --> 00:17:29.091
The champion is up!
A true veteran, to be sure!

00:17:29.115 --> 00:17:34.797
Does this mean he can't be beat
with just one technique?!

00:17:34.821 --> 00:17:36.398
That charisma...

00:17:36.422 --> 00:17:38.390
How can this be...?

00:17:41.661 --> 00:17:44.173
It's the same as back then...

00:17:44.197 --> 00:17:50.012
That grand aura that
started me on this path...

00:17:50.036 --> 00:17:51.902
This boy...

00:17:53.373 --> 00:17:56.919
...is giving off the
same aura my master did...

00:17:56.943 --> 00:17:59.989
This is a true fighting master...!

00:18:00.013 --> 00:18:01.357
Master...

00:18:01.381 --> 00:18:07.196
I've come across someone with
enough charisma to rival even you!

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:11.033
Toba-san... The crowd's waiting!

00:18:11.057 --> 00:18:13.902
Yes, so it would seem...!

00:18:13.926 --> 00:18:15.189
Oh no!

00:18:19.799 --> 00:18:21.543
He's going to do it again!

00:18:21.567 --> 00:18:24.947
This is no time to be ecstatic!
Stop him!

00:18:24.971 --> 00:18:28.784
What for? The real fight
is just starting...!

00:18:28.808 --> 00:18:32.788
His knee is in no condition
to do that move twice in a row!

00:18:32.812 --> 00:18:34.290
Come again?!

00:18:34.314 --> 00:18:38.751
One more! One more should do it...!

00:18:40.186 --> 00:18:41.984
Here goes!

00:18:45.024 --> 00:18:46.435
Baki just--

00:18:46.459 --> 00:18:49.622
--Sped up the back-flip...!

00:18:55.802 --> 00:18:58.328
Toba-san...?!

00:19:00.473 --> 00:19:03.374
Toba-san...! You're--

00:19:17.924 --> 00:19:19.335
What's wrong with him...?

00:19:19.359 --> 00:19:22.204
Giant wrestlers have short life spans.

00:19:22.228 --> 00:19:28.031
They have much greater burdens on
their knees and legs than others do.

00:19:34.374 --> 00:19:40.923
The fact that he's been active for
over 30 years is a wonder in itself.

00:19:40.947 --> 00:19:45.043
It's the fruit of his
daily training and regimen.

00:19:46.786 --> 00:19:49.431
All you can do is keep getting up...!

00:19:49.455 --> 00:19:53.688
A true fighter would keep on coming...!

00:19:56.262 --> 00:19:58.874
Keep on coming...!

00:19:58.898 --> 00:20:01.526
If you fall down, you can always bite...!

00:20:03.536 --> 00:20:07.996
Toba-san... You truly
are a superb Grappler!

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:24.986
The match is over!

00:20:26.492 --> 00:20:32.074
--Way to go, Toba!
--Baki! You did great, too!

00:20:32.098 --> 00:20:38.881
Just listen to that! Shouts of admiration
and applause for both fighters!

00:20:38.905 --> 00:20:41.617
That was incredible...

00:20:41.641 --> 00:20:43.051
Well played.

00:20:43.075 --> 00:20:47.923
Going for his knee was Baki's
courtesy toward a great man.

00:20:47.947 --> 00:20:53.328
--That was a great kick...
--I wasn't happy about it one bit!

00:20:53.352 --> 00:20:58.834
Had this been 10 years ago,
that last chop would've broken my neck!

00:20:58.858 --> 00:21:03.405
Unfortunately, it's 10 years later.

00:21:03.429 --> 00:21:09.334
| thank you. I was able to
obtain an honorable defeat...

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:17.519
Quit being so reckless!

00:21:17.543 --> 00:21:19.136
Incredible!

00:21:20.146 --> 00:21:27.329
Baki! Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:21:27.353 --> 00:21:31.800
--That Baki is quite a boy!
--Huh?

00:21:31.824 --> 00:21:36.138
Your knee! He left it
so it could heal just fine!

00:21:36.162 --> 00:21:39.975
He did break it,
but at an easy-to-fix angle!

00:21:39.999 --> 00:21:43.594
You'll need about
three months of rehab...!

00:21:44.637 --> 00:21:46.628
He beat me good...

00:21:54.647 --> 00:21:56.024
What a fool.

00:21:56.048 --> 00:21:59.450
He's as weak a brat as ever.

00:22:44.931 --> 00:22:50.479
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.503 --> 00:22:56.084
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.108 --> 00:23:01.757
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.781 --> 00:23:06.762
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.786 --> 00:23:12.301
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.325 --> 00:23:17.839
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.863 --> 00:23:23.512
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.536 --> 00:23:29.051
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.075 --> 00:23:34.723
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.747 --> 00:23:41.119
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.229 --> 00:23:52.197
"Next Episode”

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:58.780
At long last, the demon has appeared.

00:23:58.804 --> 00:24:02.951
And, as if invited by the
sweet aroma of the battlefield,

00:24:02.975 --> 00:24:06.288
a fierce shadow has descended with it.

00:24:06.312 --> 00:24:08.290
Past memories are brought to light.

00:24:08.314 --> 00:24:12.661
The two hellions begin to stir
as the day of their clash approaches.

00:24:12.685 --> 00:24:14.963
What does the boy see as they do?

00:24:14.987 --> 00:24:19.982
<i>"Next Episode: Killer Instinct”</i>
